:: Bike
<<endevent>><<effects>><<set $phase to 1>>
<<if $passagePrev isnot "Bike">><<set $bikeReturnPassage to $passagePrev>><</if>>
You climb onto your bike.
<<if $bicycle.durability.repairUse is 1>>
	<span class="yellow">You make a minor repair to your bike. It should be able to get you a little farther now.</span>
	<<set $bicycle.durability.repairUse to 0>>
<</if>>
<<if $bicycle.own and $bicycle.durability.current gt 0 and $bicycle.durability.current lt $bicycle.durability.max and $bicycle.durability.repair gt 0>>
	<br>
	<<birdicon "tools">><<link [[Use a repair kit|Bike]]>><<set $bicycle.durability.repair-->><<set _bikeKitRepair to Math.max(150, Math.round($bicycle.durability.max / 6))>><<set $bicycle.durability.current to Math.min($bicycle.durability.current + _bikeKitRepair, $bicycle.durability.max)>><<set $bicycle.durability.repairUse to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<bikeMenu 1 $bicycle.locationRegion>>
<br>
<<cancelBike>>

:: Bike Ride
<<effects>><<rng>>
<<switch $phase>>
    <<case 1>>
        <<set $phase to 0>>
        <<bikeEvents $bicycle.location>>
        <<if $bikeJourneyInterrupted is 1>>
        <<elseif $bicycle.durability.current lte 0>>
            <br><br>
            <<destinationBike $destination true>>
        <<else>>
            <br><br>
            <<bikeTransition>>
            <br><br>
            <<link [[Next|$passage]]>><</link>>
        <</if>>
    <<case 0>>
        <<set $phase to 1>>
        <<bikeEvents $destination>>
        <<if $bikeJourneyInterrupted is 1>>
        <<else>>
            <br><br>
            <<if $bicycle.durability.current lte 0>>
                <<destinationBike $destination true>>
            <<else>>
                <<destinationBike $destination>>
            <</if>>
        <</if>>
<</switch>>

/* EVENTS */
:: Bike Road Ambush
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<set $consensual to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $enemyno to 1>><<set $enemynomax to 1>><<maninit>>
	<<enable_rescue>>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<audience>>
<<stateman>>
<<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bike Road Ambush Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Bike Road Ambush]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Bike Road Ambush Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	Your attacker reels back, giving you enough room to scramble away. You grab your bike and put distance between you before <<he>> recovers.
<<elseif $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Your attacker backs off with a rough laugh, leaving you shaken beside the road. You force yourself up and look for your bike.
<<elseif $rescue is 1 and $alarm is 1>>
	Someone nearby shouts. Your attacker flinches, then bolts before anyone can get a proper look. You use the moment to pull yourself together.
<<elseif $finish is 1>>
	<<encounterEndViolence>>
	You can't take it anymore.
<<else>>
	Your attacker finally shoves you away and disappears down a side path, leaving you aching and breathless beside the bike.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>><<fameexhibitionism 1>>
<<link [[Next|Bike Road Recovery]]>><</link>>

:: Bike Road Recovery
<<effects>>
<<set $bikeJourneyInterrupted to 0>>
<<if $bicycle.durability.current lte 0>>
	Your bike is in no state to ride. You steady yourself and drag it upright, every step making the damage feel heavier.
	<<tiredness 6>><<ggtiredness>><<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	Your hands shake as you check the frame and wheels. The bike still moves, though every sound from it makes you flinch.
	<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $bicycle.durability.current lte 0>>
	<<destinationBike $destination true>>
<<else>>
	<<destinationBike $destination>>
<</if>>

:: Whitney Bike Joyride
<<effects>>
Whitney gets onto your bike and points at the metal rack behind the saddle. "Well? Get on, slut. I'm not waiting all fucking day."
<br><br>
You sit on the rack, trying to find somewhere comfortable to put your legs. The metal presses against your thighs, and the bent spoon beside the handlebars rattles when Whitney starts moving.
<br><br>
"Hold on or don't. I don't give a fuck," <<he>> says, pushing down on the pedals before you've settled properly. You grab the sides of the rack as <<he>> rides down the street.
<br><br>
At the first corner, <<he>> turns so quickly that you nearly slide sideways. Whitney doesn't slow down when the traffic light turns red, and <<he>> shouts something rude at a pedestrian who has to hurry out of the way.
<br><br>
<<link [[Hold on to <<him>>|Whitney Bike Joyride Hold]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> to slow down|Whitney Bike Joyride Slow]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Bike Joyride Hold
<<effects>>
You reach forward and wrap your arms around Whitney's waist. When <<he>> turns another corner, you press yourself against <<his>> back to stop yourself sliding across the rack.
Whitney straightens slightly when you touch <<him>>, then shifts back towards you without saying anything.
<br><br>
You can smell smoke on <<his>> clothes, and you notice dried blood near <<his>> collar. As <<he>> pedals faster, you tighten your arms around <<him>> and feel <<his>> stomach move each time <<he>> takes a breath.
<<He>> keeps riding, making no effort to move away from you.<<glove>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<glust>><<npcincr Whitney lust 5>>
<br><br>
Whitney eventually turns back towards where you started. <<He>> slows down beside the pavement and waits while you climb off the rack, then gets off the saddle and lowers the bike's stand with <<his>> foot.
<br><br>
"Brakes work," <<he>> says, pointing at the bike. "You're welcome."
<br><br>
<<He>> puts <<his>> hands in <<his>> pockets and walks away before you can reply. Near the end of the street, <<he>> looks back to see whether you're still watching.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$whitneyBikeReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $whitneyBikeReturn>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Bike Joyride Slow
<<effects>>
"Slow down!" you shout, gripping the rack as Whitney approaches another corner.
<br><br>
"Slow down? What, are you scared, slut?" <<he>> asks, laughing as <<he>> stands up on the pedals.
<br><br>
<<He>> pushes down harder with each leg, making the rack shake beneath you. You reach forward and grip the back of the saddle with both hands to stop yourself sliding off.
The brake cable <<he>> repaired rattles against the frame as the bike bounces over the road.
<br><br>
Whitney laughs until <<he>> reaches the next turn, where <<he>> sits back down to steer. You shout at <<him>> again, but by then you're laughing too.<<glove>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><<gstress>><<stress 4>>
<br><br>
When you reach the place where the ride began, Whitney suddenly squeezes the brakes. The rear wheel slides across the road before the bike stops near the pavement.
<<He>> puts one foot on the road to keep the bike upright, then looks back and sees that you're still gripping the saddle. Whitney laughs as you finally let go, move both legs to one side of the rack, and put your feet on the road.
<br><br>
Whitney lifts one leg over the saddle and stands beside the bike before pushing its stand down with <<his>> foot. "Brakes work. You're welcome; no need to fucking say it."
<br><br>
<<He>> walks away with <<his>> hands in <<his>> pockets. You watch <<him>> go, and <<he>> looks back at you before disappearing around the corner.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$whitneyBikeReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $whitneyBikeReturn>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Bike Thank
<<effects>>
You thank Whitney for fixing your bike. <<He>> looks away and pulls <<his>> hood farther over <<his>> head, although you can still see that <<his>> cheeks have turned red.
<br><br>
"Tsk. Say it again and I'll take the fucking thing back," <<he>> says, turning back towards you. 
<br><br>
Before you can answer, <<he>> turns and walks off.<<glove>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$whitneyBikeReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $whitneyBikeReturn>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Bike Ask
<<effects>>
You ask Whitney about the bruises on <<his>> face. <<He>> immediately pulls <<his>> hood forward, covering most of them before answering.
<br><br>
"What fight? I fucking tripped." <<He>> notices you looking at the bruises that are still visible and turns <<his>> face away. "Stop looking at me like that or you'll get one too."
<br><br>
<<He>> walks away before you can ask anything else.<<glust>><<npcincr Whitney lust 3>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$whitneyBikeReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $whitneyBikeReturn>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Bike Ride Alone
<<effects>>
You decide against riding with Whitney. <<He>> looks at the space behind the saddle, then steps away from your bike with a grin.
<br><br>
"Suit yourself, wimp. Don't come crying to me when you're bored."
<br><br>
<<He>> puts <<his>> hands in <<his>> pockets and walks off, leaving you with your bike.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$whitneyBikeReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $whitneyBikeReturn>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
